

@rootUrl =http://localhost:8000
#API list

### Check server status

GET {{rootUrl}}/
### Auth api


### post new user 
POST {{rootUrl}}/api/v1/auth/register
Content-Type: application/json

{
   
    "fName" : "minato ",
    "lName" : "moffktan ",
    "email" : "hello@gmail.com",
    "phone" : "112345",
    "password" : "abudnnyA!12345678"
 

}

### post activate user

POST {{rootUrl}}/api/v1/auth/activate-user
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "sessionId":"6abbf00f9e02e75251e83ff6",
  "t":"b0b4ecfb-c4d8-4e44-b614-17a2a20fb476"
   
 

}

